# Disable directory listing
Options -Indexes

# Explicitly disable RewriteEngine for this directory.
# The root .htaccess enables RewriteEngine for HTTP→HTTPS redirect.
# Turning it off here prevents that config from cascading into api/,
# which would cause LiteSpeed to silently drop POST request bodies.
RewriteEngine Off

# CORS and all response headers are set by PHP (api/config/cors.php).
# Do NOT add "Header always set" directives — mod_headers is unavailable on
# InfinityFree / LiteSpeed shared hosting and would cause a 500 error.
#
# Do NOT add RewriteEngine On here — LiteSpeed may not pass POST request
# bodies correctly when RewriteEngine is active in a sub-directory .htaccess.
# Authorization / X-Token headers are read by PHP via getallheaders() or
# the HTTP_AUTHORIZATION / HTTP_X_TOKEN server variables set by LiteSpeed
# automatically, making .htaccess rewrites unnecessary.
